        "description": "Peepi is a young elf girl whose village, Miruel Mirael, is slaughtered. She attempts to escape by smuggling herself to another area, though she is caught, and saved by K&ouml;inzell. Though she has the choice to join another village, she decides to stay with K&ouml;inzell. Her real name has yet to be revealed.",
