        "description": "Altea is a smuggler who runs a tavern under. She acts tough around the patrons, though it is really just to hide her weak personality. She is a close friend of Vid, who introduces K&ouml;inzell to her. She agrees to smuggle them after K&ouml;inzell agrees to have sex with her, though the smuggling plan soon falls short. Her business is destroyed, and she decides to travel with K&ouml;inzell, especially because he reminds her of a close friend.",
